{1027}{}{Soul Seller}
{1028}{}{Decent House}
{1029}{}{The Fifth Family}
{1127}{}{You sell what isn't yours to sell: people. In the cellars of your houses the bolts are on the outside, and everyone who has been down there knows it.}
{1128}{}{Whoever works in your houses gets their share, a doctor, and a door that locks from the inside. In the wasteland, that's enough for a good name.}
{1129}{}{New Reno had four families. Now it has five, and the fifth bears your name. The others nod when you pass. They don't mean it.}
